<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anadigics Inc cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anadigics Inc cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter downgraded Anadigics Inc to accumulate from buy, a Dean Witter source said.</p>
<p>-- Anadigics gained 1/2 to 53-3/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
